# External tools this plugin's test suite needs on a CI runner.
# One name per line; `#` comments and blank lines are ignored.
# Read by tools/plugin-requires-tool.sh, which gates the install steps in
# .github/workflows/tests.yml. A plugin with NO such file needs nothing.
#
# svn (and svnadmin, which ships with it): most of this suite builds a real local SVN repository
# with `svnadmin create` and drives it through the scripts under test. Without svn those cases
# self-SKIP -- and a SKIP counts as green here, so a missing install would look like a passing
# suite that tested nothing.
svn
